ents of a presenting problem), idea generation (developing solutions to those problems), and implementation (putting those solutions into practice). The course includes lecture-based content and activities around these topics and features participation in a weekend-long hackathon event that serves as a practicum experience where students will generate, develop, and pitch an idea related to a societal or business challenge.", "catalogBreadth": null, "catalogDistr": null, "catalogEnrollmentPriority": "", "catalogLang": null, "catalogForbiddenOverlaps": null, "catalogAttribute": null, "catalogWhenOffered": null, "catalogComments": null, "catalogPrereqCoreq": null, "catalogPrereq": "", "catalogCoreq": "", "catalogFee": null, "catalogSatisfiesReq": null, "catalogPermission": null, "catalogCourseSubfield": null, "catalogOutcomes": ["Identify real problems (a.k.a., pain points).", "Effectively ideate creative solutions, including thinking through the idea's feasability, viability, and novelty.", "Recognize how technologies and solutions from one industry can be adapted to solve teh pain points of another industry."], "acadCareer": "UG", "acadGroup": "IL", "catalogName": null, "catalogNextOffered": null, "lastTermsOffered": "2025FA, 2024FA", "catalogCredits": null, "catalogGradeOption": null, "catalogLocation": null, "catalogCrosslisted": null, "catalogCrosslistings": null, "catalogComeets": null, "exploreCriteriaIds": []}, {"strm": 2909, "crseId": 367804, "crseOfferNbr": 1, "subject": "ILROB", "catalogNbr": "3270", "titleShort": "Social Capital & Organizations", "titleLong": "Social Capital and Organizations", "crseAttrs": [{"crseAttr": "0012", "crseAttrValue": "AWI-IL", "descr": "IL-Advanced Writing Intensive", "descrformal": "IL-Advanced Writing Intensive Elective", "attrDescr": "Distribution Requirements", "attrDescrShort": "DistReq"}, {"crseAttr": "0012", "crseAttrValue": "ICE-IL", "descr": "IL-In-College Advanced Electiv", "descrformal": "IL-In-College Advanced Electi